  "policies": [
    "Customer and Contact store CAS return Option<i32>; only None becomes a typed Conflict409 in the caller, before its transaction commits. Genuine sqlx failure remains500. Existing business-managed session and registered contact field audit remain in that same transaction and roll back with CAS/SQL failure.",
    "Customer business changes are computed before assigning updated_by. Actor-only and UUID-case-only requests create no business dirty/version/time/actor/audit write; pending session maintenance retains its existing path.",
    "owner_org_id and owner_user_id compare parsed optional UUID values for change detection; invalid values propagate internal invariant error rather than collapsing to None. Valid absence/explicit clear retain original presence semantics. DTO validation is unchanged.",
    "Private ListContext organization map uses Uuid keys and parses raw ownerOrgId on lookup; immediate name agrees with GET while the existing raw response ID representation is preserved.",
    "Only customers/{service,store}.rs and customer_contacts/{service,store}.rs product files changed. All Service methods, HTTP/DTO/DDL/permission/contracts/client, Root shared and projects modules remain untouched."
  ],
